{"config":{"lang":["en"],"separator":"[\\s\\-]+","pipeline":["stopWordFilter"],"fields":{"title":{"boost":1000.0},"text":{"boost":1.0},"tags":{"boost":1000000.0}}},"docs":[{"location":"","title":"# Welcome to Your Hurricane\u2011Proof House","text":""},{"location":"#_1","title":"Home","text":""},{"location":"#compliance-checkboxes-are-like-a-stack-of-lumber-and-hurricane-straps-on-a-building-site","title":"Compliance checkboxes are like a stack of lumber and hurricane straps on a building site.","text":""},{"location":"#resilience-is-what-happens-when-you-engineer-them-together-into-a-house-that-stands-through-the-storm","title":"**Resilience** is what happens when you engineer them together into a house that stands through the storm.","text":""},{"location":"#_2","title":"Home","text":""},{"location":"#this-documentation-teaches-you-to-build-that-house-using-cloudflare-workers-as-your-tools","title":"This documentation teaches you to build that house \u2013 using **Cloudflare Workers** as your tools.","text":""},{"location":"#_3","title":"Home","text":""},{"location":"#start-here","title":"## Start here","text":""},{"location":"#_4","title":"Home","text":""},{"location":"#-new-to-resilience-tutorialstutorials","title":"- **New to resilience** \u2192 [Tutorials](tutorials/)","text":""},{"location":"#-deep-dive-the-deep-foundationtutorialsfoundationmd","title":"- **Deep dive** \u2192 [The Deep Foundation](tutorials/foundation.md)","text":""},{"location":"#-coming-soon-reinforced-roof-impactresistant-windows","title":"- **Coming soon** \u2013 Reinforced Roof, Impact\u2011Resistant Windows","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/","title":"Overview","text":"<p># Tutorials</p> <p>- [The Deep Foundation](foundation.md)</p>"},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/","title":"# The Deep Foundation: Asset \\&amp; Identity Management","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#_1","title":"The Deep Foundation","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#tutorial-objective-understand-why-a-continuous-reinforced-foundation-is-the-nonnegotiable-first-layer-of-a-hurricaneproof-house-and-how-to-build-yours-with-cloudflare-workers-and-kv","title":"*Tutorial objective: Understand why a continuous, reinforced foundation is the non\u2011negotiable first layer of a hurricane\u2011proof house \u2013 and how to build yours with Cloudflare Workers and KV.*","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#_2","title":"The Deep Foundation","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#-","title":"---","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#_3","title":"The Deep Foundation","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#the-analogy-why-checkboxes-crack","title":"## \ud83e\uddf1 The Analogy: Why Checkboxes Crack","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#_4","title":"The Deep Foundation","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#imagine-two-houses-before-a-category-5-hurricane","title":"Imagine two houses before a Category 5 hurricane:","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#_5","title":"The Deep Foundation","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#-house-a-checkbox-thinking","title":"- **House A (Checkbox Thinking)**","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#the-builder-has-a-checklist-pour-concrete-footer-done-install-anchor-bolts-done-but-the-footer-is-cracked-the-bolts-are-rusted-and-no-one-checked-that-the-soil-underneath-was-compacted-when-the-storm-hits-the-house-slides-off-its-foundation-and-disintegrates","title":"The builder has a checklist: \u201cPour concrete footer \u2013 done. Install anchor bolts \u2013 done.\u201d But the footer is cracked, the bolts are rusted, and no one checked that the soil underneath was compacted. When the storm hits, the house slides off its foundation and disintegrates.","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#_6","title":"The Deep Foundation","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#-house-b-demonstrable-resilience","title":"- **House B (Demonstrable Resilience)**","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#the-builder-engineered-a-deep-foundation-a-continuous-monolithic-slab-with-steel-rebar-tied-into-every-wall-a-drainage-system-to-prevent-erosion-and-weekly-inspections-of-the-soil-moisture-the-house-stays-standing-the-family-survives","title":"The builder engineered a **deep foundation**: a continuous monolithic slab with steel rebar tied into every wall, a drainage system to prevent erosion, and weekly inspections of the soil moisture. The house stays standing \u2013 the family survives.","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#_7","title":"The Deep Foundation","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#compliance-checkboxes-are-house-a-you-get-an-audit-certificate-but-you-have-no-actual-resilience-demonstrable-resilience-is-house-b-you-can-prove-with-live-data-logs-and-automated-responses-that-your-foundation-will-hold","title":"**Compliance checkboxes** are House A. You get an audit certificate, but you have no *actual* resilience. **Demonstrable resilience** is House B. You can prove \u2013 with live data, logs, and automated responses \u2013 that your foundation will hold.","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#_8","title":"The Deep Foundation","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#in-our-toolkit-the-foundation-is-made-of-two-materials","title":"In our toolkit, the foundation is made of two materials:","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#_9","title":"The Deep Foundation","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#1-asset-management-knowing-what-you-are-protecting-rebar-inventory","title":"1. **Asset management** \u2013 Knowing *what* you are protecting (rebar inventory).","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#2-identity-access-management-knowing-who-can-touch-it-the-locks-on-the-doors","title":"2. **Identity \\&amp; access management** \u2013 Knowing *who* can touch it (the locks on the doors).","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#_10","title":"The Deep Foundation","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#-_1","title":"---","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#_11","title":"The Deep Foundation","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#component-1-asset-management-the-continuous-inventory","title":"## \ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Component 1: Asset Management \u2013 The Continuous Inventory","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#_12","title":"The Deep Foundation","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#a-checkbox-foundation-says-we-did-an-asset-inventory-once-last-year","title":"A checkbox foundation says: \u201cWe did an asset inventory once last year.\u201d","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#a-resilient-foundation-says-our-asset-inventory-updates-itself-automatically-and-we-audit-changes-every-hour","title":"A resilient foundation says: \u201cOur asset inventory updates itself automatically, and we audit changes every hour.\u201d","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#_13","title":"The Deep Foundation","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#how-to-build-it-with-cloudflare-workers-kv","title":"### How to Build It with Cloudflare Workers KV","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#_14","title":"The Deep Foundation","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#cloudflare-workers-kv-is-a-globally-distributed-lowlatency-keyvalue-store-think-of-it-as-your-digital-rebar-ledger-every-asset-you-care-about-api-endpoints-customer-data-buckets-affiliate-links-compliance-logs-gets-a-unique-key-and-a-current-state","title":"**Cloudflare Workers KV** is a globally distributed, low\u2011latency key\u2011value store. Think of it as your digital **rebar ledger** \u2013 every asset you care about (API endpoints, customer data buckets, affiliate links, compliance logs) gets a unique key and a current state.","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#_15","title":"The Deep Foundation","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#stepbystep-your-first-assettracking-worker","title":"#### Step\u2011by\u2011Step: Your First Asset\u2011Tracking Worker","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#_16","title":"The Deep Foundation","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#create-a-new-worker-that-listens-for-asset-changes-eg-a-new-esim-provider-is-added-to-your-comparison-table-and-writes-the-change-to-kv","title":"Create a new Worker that listens for asset changes (e.g., a new eSIM provider is added to your comparison table) and writes the change to KV.","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#_17","title":"The Deep Foundation","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#javascript","title":"```javascript","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#asset-tracker-worker-skeleton","title":"// Asset Tracker Worker skeleton","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#export-default","title":"export default {","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#async-fetchrequest-env","title":"async fetch(request, env) {","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#if-requestmethod-post-requesturlendswithassets","title":"if (request.method === 'POST' \\&amp;\\&amp; request.url.endsWith('/assets')) {","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#const-asset-await-requestjson","title":"const asset = await request.json();","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#store-with-key-asset-and-ttl-of-30-days","title":"// Store with key \"asset:\" and TTL of 30 days","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#await-envasset_kvputassetassetid-jsonstringifyasset-expirationttl-2592000","title":"await env.ASSET_KV.put(<code>asset:${asset.id}</code>, JSON.stringify(asset), { expirationTtl: 2592000 });","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#also-write-an-audit-log-entry","title":"// Also write an audit log entry","text":""},{"location":"tutorials/foundation/#await-envaudit_kvputauditdatenow-jsonstringify-action-create-asset","title":"await env.AUDIT_KV.put(<code>audit:${Date.now()}</code>, JSON.stringify({ action: 'CREATE', asset }));","text":""